1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:03,575
M: Hi, I saw a for-rent sign on your lobby window.

2
00:00:04,455 --> 00:00:06,240
I am looking for a two-bedroom apartment.

3
00:00:06,695 --> 00:00:07,595
W: You are in luck.

4
00:00:08,055 --> 00:00:14,475
We do have an available apartment for rent on the fifth floor, and I think it may be exactly what you're looking for.

5
00:00:14,765 --> 00:00:17,775
It has two bedrooms, and the rent is quite reasonable.

6
00:00:18,175 --> 00:00:24,135
In fact, I don't think you will be able to find a place like this for a price this low anywhere near here.

7
00:00:24,575 --> 00:00:24,935
M: Really?

8
00:00:25,370 --> 00:00:27,295
Do you think I can take a look at it right now?

9
00:00:27,815 --> 00:00:29,775
I really am in a hurry to find a place.

10
00:00:30,075 --> 00:00:30,855
W: Of course.

11
00:00:31,195 --> 00:00:33,585
Just give me a second, and I will get the key.
